  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Alkyl halide undergoes&nbsp;nucleophilic substitution reaction. More nucleophilic nitrogen of amine group, more reactive will it be with alkyl halides.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Presence of electron-withdrawing group will decrease the nucleophilic character of amino group.</p><p>Hence the order of reactivity;</p><p><img height=\"160\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3c8544f3-97eb-463e-884d-c8b00f21371a-image.png\" width=\"375\" /></p><p><img height=\"202\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/54609d56-b5ae-4c1e-92db-6f8a77889113-image.png\" width=\"447\" /></p>",
